  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ccRjlaX.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=5865F2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=252A36&amp;labelColor=FF424D&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p><p><strong>关于：</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p><p>在这里，你可以找到 Mandala's GUI 的所有“材质附加包”。</p><p>部分“材质附加包”是独立于此项目的 [例如：酿造指南开启]。<br>请将材质附加包放置在原版材质包之上。</p><p><strong>特点：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>模组支持 [由创作者和社区提供]。</li>\n<li>所有模组都有其“深色模式”版本。</li>\n<li>所有兼容性都支持 Mandalas GUI 的两个版本 [深色模式和浅色模式]。</li>\n</ul><p>如果你想成为贡献者，请通过 Discord 发送消息，我将详细说明要求。<br>所有拥有 Curse Forge 账户的贡献者都可以因其工作获得相应的奖励。 ❤</p><p><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on/files/4523692\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oYbBBdq.gif\" width=\"350\" height=\"200\"></a></p><p><strong>兼容模组 [目前 120 个]：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ol>\n<li>JEI 1.19.2 至 1.21.5<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>JADE 1.19.2 至 1.21.5<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>JERESOURCES 1.19.2 至 1.21.5<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>JUSTENOUGHPROFESSIONS 1.19.2 至 1.21.5<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>ROUGHLYENOUGHITEMS<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>abyssal_decor</li>\n<li>advancementplaques<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>aether<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>aether_redux<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>deep_aether<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">&nbsp;♥</span></strong></span></li>\n<li>alexscaves<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>alexsmobs<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>alloy_forgery</li>\n<li>appleskin<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>aquaculture<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>armorpointspp</li>\n<li>artifacts<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>backpacked</li>\n<li>betteradvancements<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>betterarcheology</li>\n<li>betterend<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>betterendforge<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> ♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>blue_skies</li>\n<li>botanypots</li>\n<li>botanypotstiers</li>\n<li>cataclysm<strong> <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">♥</span></strong></li>\n<li>catalogue</li>\n<li>cfm</li>\n<li>cherishedworlds</li>\n<li>chocobos</li>\n<li>chococraft<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">♥</span></strong></span></li>\n<li>cloth-config2<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">♥</span></strong></span></li>\n<li>companions</li>\n<li>configured<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">♥</span></strong></span></li>\n<li>corpse<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&n